## 🛠️ Technology Stack

| Layer            | Technology                      |
| ---------------- | ------------------------------- |
| Language         | Python 3.12                     |
| Web framework    | Flask 3.0                       |
| Database         | SQLite 3 (via `sqlite3`)        |
| Templating       | Jinja2                          |
| Money math       | Python `Decimal`                |
| Passwords        | `werkzeug.security`             |
| Frontend         | HTML5, CSS3 (custom), Vanilla JS |
| Dev tools        | VS Code / PowerShell            |

